 "chapter": {
  "number": 121,
  "introduction": "David assures himself of help from God, ver. 1, 2. He assures others of it, ver. 3-8. A song of degrees.",
  "content": [
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 1,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "Hills - To Sion and Moriah, which are called the holy mountains."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 5,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "Shade - To keep thee from the burning heat of the sun."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 6,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "Smite - With excessive heat. Moon - With that cold and moisture which come into the air by it. Intemperate heats and colds are the springs of many diseases."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
